       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CONDITIONALPASS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 FLAG PIC X.
       01 TARGET PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN.
       MOVE 'KEEP' TO TARGET.
       PERFORM BODY.
       CALL TARGET.
       GOBACK.
       BODY.
       IF FLAG = 'Y'
       MOVE 'NEW' TO TARGET
       ELSE
       CONTINUE
       END-IF.
       EXIT.
       TAIL.
       MOVE 'POISON' TO TARGET.
       GOBACK.
